9,Sherpa language,https://grokipedia.com/page/Sherpa_language,"The Sherpa language belongs to the Sino-Tibetan language family, specifically within the Tibeto-Burman branch, where it is classified under the Bodic subgroup, Bodish division, and Tibetic group.",Sherpa,Sino-Tibetan
